@startuml
title Selected Architecture 1 - Expense Submission and Approval
start
:Authenticate submitter;
:Begin write transaction; acquire group access guard;
:Validate current membership, participants,
explicit payer, positive precise amount,
date, description, exact split and optional receipt;
if (Valid?) then (yes)
  :Save PENDING_REVIEW, exact allocations,
captured policy version and receipt metadata;
  :Insert outbox and eligible other-member candidates;
  :Commit submission; balances unchanged;
else (no)
  :Roll back; return field/action errors;
  stop
endif
:After commit, dispatcher retries notices;
note right
  Local SQLite inbox for MVP.
  Full product outbox worker.
  Recheck current access and skip removed recipients.
  Unique inbox records; delivery failure never undoes expense.
end note
while (Expense still pending?) is (yes)
  :Await reviewer request outside transaction;
  :Authenticate; begin new write transaction;
  :Acquire group guard and recheck current access;
  if (Authorized?) then (yes)
    :Reserve or load scoped OperationReceipt;
  else (no)
    :Roll back; deny request;
    stop
  endif
  if (Accepted receipt exists?) then (yes)
    if (Request hash matches?) then (yes)
      :End transaction; return saved decision;
    else (no)
      :Roll back; return idempotency conflict;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Lock expense; reload state;
    :Validate captured policy, eligible reviewer,
level, self-review rule and pending state;
    if (Valid new decision?) then (yes)
      :Insert immutable decision;
      if (Reject?) then (yes)
        :Set REJECTED; save OperationReceipt;
        :Commit without ledger postings;
        stop
      else (approve)
        if (All required approvals complete?) then (yes)
          :Acquire affected pair guards in sorted order;
          :Set APPROVED and append unique nonzero
non-payer debt postings to explicit payer;
        endif
        :Save OperationReceipt;
        :Commit decision, state, postings and receipt together;
      endif
    else (no)
      :Roll back; return validation or state conflict;
    endif
  endif
endwhile (no)
:Read committed expense and balances;
stop
@enduml
